        "payload": "tree d99cd3e3de3af37177473be1ffab514c03d04d5b\nparent e3922a2b2d976487cb4cf4e7b0ac290b3ce77f66\nauthor Avery L. <Averyy@users.noreply.github.com> 1790529474 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790529474 +0800\n\nfix(emulate): correct broken User-Agent literals (Edge, Firefox 139, Safari 17.2.1) (#118)\n\n* fix(emulate): restore Edge 134-141 User-Agent and sec-ch-ua\n\nThe UA stopped at Chrome/NNN.0.0.0, dropping Safari/537.36 and the Edg/\ntoken, and sec-ch-ua lost its closing quote. Desktop rows now end in\nSafari/537.36 Edg/NNN.0.0.0 and Android rows in\nMobile Safari/537.36 EdgA/NNN.0.0.0, per Microsoft's UA guidance.\n\n* fix(emulate): reduce the Edg/ token in Edge 146/147\n\nDesktop rows sent the full build (Edg/146.0.3856.109). Edge sends\nEdg/MAJOR.0.0.0, as every other desktop Edge row from 122 on does.\n\n* fix(emulate): send rv:139.0 in Firefox 139 on Windows and Linux\n\nThese rows said rv:136.0 next to Firefox/139.0.\n\n* fix(emulate): fix Safari 17.2.1 and Chrome Android UA typos\n\nSafari17_2_1 sent Version/16.0, and Chrome 106-131 Android rows had\n\"(Linux: Android\" for \"(Linux; Android\".\n\n* test: check emulated User-Agent and sec-ch-ua literals\n\nLocal-server tests; they fail on the previous literals.",
